---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../../components/Layout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../../components/Eyebrow.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About · Localis"
  description="Localis was started by Domenico and Luigi Loconsole, born in Bari. It began with an audio guide on the mysteries of Modugno. Now we tell the story of Puglia."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="max-w-narrow mx-auto px-md py-2xl">
    <Eyebrow class="mb-md">About us</Eyebrow>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-ink mb-lg">Localis is a Puglia-born editorial project.</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-ink max-w-prose">
      <p>
        Domenico and Luigi Loconsole, born in Bari, write narrative audio guides about Puglia grounded in verifiable archival research (all sources published at <a href="/en/fonti">/fonti</a>, chapter by chapter) and oral memory gathered on the ground.
      </p>
      <p>
        The voices you hear are synthetic, not human. This is a deliberate editorial choice: the people who can describe an alley perfectly over a coffee often freeze in front of a microphone. We prefer to leave the stories in the words of those who gave them to us, and entrust the reading to a tool that won't betray them. We are working to progressively replace the synthetic voices with professional Pugliese narrators.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our defining claim: we are the only Italian publisher that releases audio guides with verifiable academic bibliographies, chapter by chapter.
      </p>

      <h2>Roadmap</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Edition 01 — Puglia:</strong> 18 guides published, synthetic voices. October 2025 – May 2026.</li>
        <li><strong>In progress:</strong> progressive replacement of AI voices with professional Pugliese narrators.</li>
        <li><strong>Edition 02:</strong> location to be confirmed, planned 2027.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
